# VM Automation Agent

Automatically start PostgreSQL VMs and seed them with test data when your system boots or wakes from sleep.

## Features

✅ **Automatic VM Startup** - Detects and starts all VMs with names starting with "pg"
✅ **PostgreSQL Database Seeding** - Automatically inserts 10-15 random records per table
✅ **System Event Monitoring** - Triggers on system restart or wake from sleep
✅ **Desktop Notifications** - Shows popup when data import completes
✅ **Cross-Platform** - Works on Windows, macOS, and Linux
✅ **Configurable** - JSON-based configuration for easy customization
✅ **CLI Interface** - Command-line tools for testing and management

## Requirements

- Python 3.8+
- Oracle VirtualBox with PostgreSQL VMs
- PostgreSQL database running in VirtualBox VMs
- psycopg2 (installed automatically)

